{"format":"coupole-schema/1","id":"ligne_des_noeuds","taille":[760,380],"titre":{"fr":"Ligne des nœuds et saisons d'éclipses","en":"Line of nodes and eclipse seasons"},"alt":{"fr":"L'orbite de la Lune est inclinée de 5,1° sur l'écliptique ; elle le coupe en deux nœuds. La ligne des nœuds garde à peu près sa direction pendant l'année : deux fois par an elle pointe vers le Soleil, et les éclipses deviennent possibles (saisons d'éclipses).","en":"The Moon's orbit is tilted 5.1° to the ecliptic, crossing it at two nodes. The line of nodes keeps roughly the same direction through the year: twice a year it points at the Sun, and eclipses become possible (eclipse seasons)."},"elements":[{"t":"ellipse","c":[380,190],"rx":300,"ry":120,"rot":0,"style":{"trait":"grille","fond":null,"ep":1}},{"t":"cercle","c":[380,190],"r":26,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"soleil","ep":1.5}},{"t":"ellipse","c":[680.0,190.0],"rx":52,"ry":20,"rot":-8,"style":{"trait":"fin","fond":null,"ep":1}},{"t":"ligne","p":[[618.0,190.0],[742.0,190.0]],"style":{"trait":"accent","fond":null,"ep":1.5,"tirets":[5,3]}},{"t":"cercle","c":[680.0,190.0],"r":9,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"terre","ep":1.5}},{"t":"texte","p":[680.0,230.0],"txt":{"fr":"saison d'éclipses","en":"eclipse season"},"taille":12,"ancre":"m","base":"milieu","couleur":"accent"},{"t":"ellipse","c":[380.0,70.0],"rx":52,"ry":20,"rot":-8,"style":{"trait":"fin","fond":null,"ep":1}},{"t":"ligne","p":[[318.0,70.0],[442.0,70.0]],"style":{"trait":"accent","fond":null,"ep":1.5,"tirets":[5,3]}},{"t":"cercle","c":[380.0,70.0],"r":9,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"terre","ep":1.5}},{"t":"texte","p":[380.0,36.0],"txt":{"fr":"pas d'éclipse","en":"no eclipse"},"taille":12,"ancre":"m","base":"milieu","couleur":"fin"},{"t":"ellipse","c":[80.0,190.0],"rx":52,"ry":20,"rot":-8,"style":{"trait":"fin","fond":null,"ep":1}},{"t":"ligne","p":[[18.0,190.0],[142.0,190.0]],"style":{"trait":"accent","fond":null,"ep":1.5,"tirets":[5,3]}},{"t":"cercle","c":[80.0,190.0],"r":9,"st